

@1213 = ~Mastery of Shadow: Greater Shape of Shadow~
@1214 = ~Mastery of Shadow: Greater Shape of Shadow:

Through extensive practice, the shadow walker strengthens his bond with the Demiplane of Shadow and draws more of it into his transformation. He may now become a shade. Only weapons of +2 enchantment or better can harm him, and he gains 15% magic resistance. His touch deals an additional 1D8 cold damage and drains 1 experience level if the victim fails a saving throw at -4, or 1 point of Strength if the save succeeds.~

@1215 = ~Mastery of Shadow: Shadow Walk~
@1216 = ~Mastery of Shadow: Shadow Walk:

Having mastered the art of entering and leaving the Plane of Shadow, the shadow walker can use it to travel. He enters the plane, follows a straight path to the shadow of his destination, and emerges there. The journey takes only seconds and appears to be teleportation to anyone unfamiliar with the trick. He may use this power five times per day.~
@12161 = ~Shadow Walk~

@1217 = ~Mastery of Shadow: Animate Shadows~
@1218 = ~Mastery of Shadow: Animate Shadows:

The shadow walker can lend shadows a limited form of intelligence. Each use animates 3D4 shadows as 3-HD creatures. They have the usual Strength-draining touch and can only be harmed by magical weapons, but do not create new shadows when they kill a creature.~
@12181 = ~Animate Shadows~
@12182 = ~Shadow~ //IWDEE Compatibility

@1219 = ~Arcane Mastery: Additional School: Enchantment~
@1220 = ~Arcane Mastery: Additional School: Enchantment:

Years of magical practice have given the shadow walker an almost instinctive understanding of the arcane. He can now grasp Enchantment spells, whose workings overlap with the schools he already knows. Choosing this ability allows him to cast Enchantment spells in addition to his existing repertoire.~

@1221 = ~Arcane Mastery: Instinctive Casting~
@1222 = ~Arcane Mastery: Instinctive Casting:

Requires: The character must be able to cast Enchantment spells.

As his arcane knowledge grows, the shadow walker casts his spells more instinctively. Choosing this ability increases his daily casting capacity to 5 spells per spell level.~

@1223 = ~Arcane Mastery: Higher Spell Level~
@1224 = ~Arcane Mastery: Higher Spell Level:

Requires: The character must be able to cast Enchantment spells.

The shadow walker's intuitive understanding of magic lets him go beyond his original training. Choosing this ability grants access to level 5 spells, including Enchantment spells, with one casting per day. It may be selected up to 5 times, each selection adding one daily casting.~
